# Atlas Cloud's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-atlascloud-setting-api-key = 从 https://www.atlascloud.ai/console 获取的标准 Atlas Cloud API 密钥。需要账号余额读取权限：使用账号所有者的密钥，团队则使用 Account Admin 或 Finance 密钥。公钥 ID（ak_…）无法用于身份验证。

## The report: the account's prepaid balance.

usage-atlascloud-available-balance = 可用余额
